 Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November ran 38% of normal while June to July ran 165%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 20606 hit 61% that year.</p>"}
